      <revisionDesc>
         <change isodate="2025-02-24" n="1" resp="#projectstaff-17">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Fol. 27r, system 5, measure 2 has double lenght. Split it with a barline in the edition. Made the barline invisible.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change isodate="2025-02-24" n="2" resp="#projectstaff-17">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Fol. 26v, system 5, the last barline is missing. Made the barline invisible.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change isodate="2025-05-26" n="3" resp="#projectstaff-17">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Fol. 27r, system 5, measure 5, second chord, it looks like the bass note was an "E" and parts of it have been erased to make it look like a "C". This would make musically sense because the "E" is dissonant. Indicated with del-tag.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
      </revisionDesc>
